==Description==

The [[Image:Silk_CubicSurface_44.svg|32px]] '''Silk CubicSurface_44''' command creates a cubic surface from a [[Image:Silk_ControlGrid44.svg|16px]] [[Silk_ControlGrid44|ControlGrid44]].

